OL,3,CPedestrian in his 70s dies after being
OL,4,Chit by HGV
OL,6,FA pedestrian in his 70s has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a HGV.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to Lake
OL,10,FRoad in Ambleside shortly before
OL,11,F4:30pm yesterday (29th July).
OL,13,FAn air ambulance was also in
OL,14,Fattendance, but a man in his 70s died.
OL,16,FPolice are encouraging anyone who
OL,17,Fwitnessed the collision or has any
OL,18,Finformation, including dashcam, CCTV
OL,19,For doorbell footage, to come forward.
